// Title: WinRAR Execution in Non-Standard Folder
// ID: 4ede543c-e098-43d9-a28f-dd784a13132f
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Tigzy
// Date: 2021-11-17
// Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
// Description: Detects a suspicious WinRAR execution in a folder which is not the default installation folder
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((((process.executable endswith "\\rar.exe" or process.executable endswith "\\winrar.exe")) or ((Description == "Command line RAR" or Description == "WinRAR"))) and not ((((process.executable like "*_:\\Program Files (x86)\\WinRAR\\*" or process.executable like "*_:\\Program Files\\WinRAR\\*")) or (process.executable endswith "\\UnRAR.exe"))) and not ((process.executable like "*_:\\Windows\\Temp\\*")))
